<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46188" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζευκτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζεύγνυμι</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>yoked, harnessed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.278b
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>joined in pairs</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλαμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					24.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίχος ἡρῴῳ ζ. ποδί</span>,
			of the pentameter, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.9
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Damag.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>joined</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορθμὸς γεφύρᾳ ζευκτός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					10.2.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζευκτόν, τό</span>,= 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζεῦγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.49
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.30
			</span></i>.</div>
